    "n": 2059,
    "hash": "fd1913369b",
    "en": "|cff00ff00HINT|r\nUtok is a semi-hero that can carry items. If he dies in combat, you can revive him in the Great Hall, however he will have to bring his lost items back. \nUtok's level progression depends on Side Quests completion.",
